      "articles": [
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a12909664cad6db7f0da",
          "user_id": "6abfc982f0821082b2816089",
          "title": "自检用文章",
          "content": "光合作用分为光反应和暗反应两个阶段。\n\n光反应在类囊体薄膜上进行，需要光直接参与，产物是 ATP 和 NADPH。\n\n暗反应在叶绿体基质中进行，不需要光直接参与，但要用掉光反应产出的 ATP 和 NADPH。\n\n中午光照最强时，气孔关闭导致二氧化碳供应不足，光合作用反而下降，这叫光合午休。",
          "char_count": 145,
          "created_at": 1791009064974
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "title": "光合作用为什么分两步？",
          "content": "光合作用分为光反应和暗反应两个阶段。\n\n光反应在类囊体薄膜上进行，需要光直接参与，产物是 ATP 和 NADPH。\n\n暗反应在叶绿体基质中进行，不需要光直接参与，但要用掉光反应产出的 ATP 和 NADPH。\n\n中午光照最强时，气孔关闭导致二氧化碳供应不足，光合作用反而下降，这叫光合午休。",
          "char_count": 145,
          "created_at": 1791009269629
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a129f2949cf0bddc357c",
          "article_id": "6ac0a12909664cad6db7f0da",
          "user_id": "6abfc982f0821082b2816089",
          "seq": 1,
          "text": "光合作用分为光反应和暗反应两个阶段。"
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a12af2949cf0bddc3585",
          "article_id": "6ac0a12909664cad6db7f0da",
          "user_id": "6abfc982f0821082b2816089",
          "seq": 2,
          "text": "光反应在类囊体薄膜上进行，需要光直接参与，产物是 ATP 和 NADPH。"
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1f68b0da47cf40ab26c",
          "article_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 1,
          "text": "光合作用分为光反应和暗反应两个阶段。"
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1f699c624830197442a",
          "article_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 2,
          "text": "光反应在类囊体薄膜上进行，需要光直接参与，产物是 ATP 和 NADPH。"
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1f7862066debe897432",
          "article_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 3,
          "text": "暗反应在叶绿体基质中进行，不需要光直接参与，但要用掉光反应产出的 ATP 和 NADPH。"
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1f77ad52d07cd00635c",
          "article_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 4,
          "text": "中午光照最强时，气孔关闭导致二氧化碳供应不足，光合作用反而下降，这叫光合午休。"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "article_id": "6ac0a1f63d029ce81a489cc1",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "tone_code": "bicker",
          "status": "generated",
          "line_count": 14,
          "pending_confirm": 0,
          "preview": [
            "光合作用为什么分两步？我觉得根本没必要。",
            "怎么没必要？它本来就分光反应和暗反应两个阶段。"
          ],
          "created_at": 1791009274335
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_lines": [
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fb7ae7087f8446d9b2",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 1,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "光合作用为什么分两步？我觉得根本没必要。",
          "source_paragraph": 1,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fbce5ec960c9bae652",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 2,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "怎么没必要？它本来就分光反应和暗反应两个阶段。",
          "source_paragraph": 1,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fbfe975f7c84a51322",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 3,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "那光反应到底在哪儿进行？",
          "source_paragraph": 2,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fc99c6248301974498",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 4,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "在类囊体薄膜上，而且需要光直接参与。",
          "source_paragraph": 2,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fc9755e3f85adb5130",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 5,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "它产出什么？",
          "source_paragraph": 2,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fc8a5c78af1f4d99ba",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 6,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "产物是 ATP 和 NADPH。",
          "source_paragraph": 2,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fd466d41bad7011540",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 7,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "暗反应呢？它在哪儿？",
          "source_paragraph": 3,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fd862066debe8974bc",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 8,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "在叶绿体基质中进行，不需要光直接参与。",
          "source_paragraph": 3,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fd7ad52d07cd0063ed",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 9,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "不需要光，那它自己就能干？",
          "source_paragraph": 3,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1feeef9cb3c25807597",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 10,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "不行，它要用掉光反应产出的 ATP 和 NADPH。",
          "source_paragraph": 3,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fe652341e9ea59919b",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 11,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "那中午光照最强，光合作用应该最旺吧？",
          "source_paragraph": 4,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1fef0821082b28f4bcd",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 12,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "反而下降，这叫光合午休。",
          "source_paragraph": 4,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1ffe0ec194ad98c5307",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 13,
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "为什么？光那么强。",
          "source_paragraph": 4,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        },
        {
          "_id": "6ac0a1ffa7c4326ddb7a46ae",
          "script_id": "6ac0a1fa652341e9ea599133",
          "user_id": "6ac0a1f57ad52d07cd00633e",
          "seq": 14,
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "因为气孔关闭，二氧化碳供应不足。",
          "source_paragraph": 4,
          "flag": "",
          "confirmed": false
        }
      ],
